What this file is
  The immediate live-testing picture: what's next, what's blocking it, and the latest
  result. It is kept SHORT: finished items move to docs/testing-history.log (the full
  record, append-only), and this file is trimmed. The server session maintains both
  (CLAUDE.md, #131); the PyCharm session adds offline results; the web session reads
  them. Never put tokens, .env contents or players' personal data here (public repo).

